    <item>
      <title>HarmonyOS NEXT 彻底放弃 AOSP 兼容，微内核与 AOT 构建第三条移动 OS 路径</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/geek001/post/20260905/HarmonyOS-NEXT-%E5%BD%BB%E5%BA%95%E6%94%BE%E5%BC%83-AOSP-%E5%85%BC%E5%AE%B9%E5%BE%AE%E5%86%85%E6%A0%B8%E4%B8%8E-AOT-%E6%9E%84%E5%BB%BA%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%89%E6%9D%A1%E7%A7%BB%E5%8A%A8-OS-%E8%B7%AF%E5%BE%84/</link>
